**.subckt tb_linearity_8xPI_top
Vin3 vinI GND dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 0, 25p, 25p, 225p, 500p)
Vin4 vinQ GND dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 125p, 25p, 25p, 225p, 500p )
Vin5 vinIB GND dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 250p, 25p, 25p, 225p, 500p )
Vin6 vinQB GND dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 375p, 25p, 25p, 225p, 500p )
x4 VDD vinI VoutI1 VoutQ1 vinQ vinIB VoutIB1 vinQB VoutQB1 VSS 4to4
Vdd4 VDD VSS 1.2
Vdd1 v1 VSS dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 40n, 25p, 25p, 40n, 80n)
Vdd2 v0 VSS dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 20n, 25p, 25p, 40n, 80n)
Vdd3 VSS GND 0
x1 VoutI1 VoutIB1 VoutQ1 VoutQB1 v1 v0 vXOR v6_st v5_st v4_st v3_st v2_st v1_st v0_st Vout VDD VSS 8xPI
C1 Vout VSS 25f m=1
x2 VoutI2 VoutIB2 VoutQ2 VoutQB2 VSS VSS VSS VSS VSS VSS VSS VSS VSS VSS Vout8I VDD VSS 8xPI
C2 Vout8I VSS 25f m=1
