Vdd6 v0_st VSS dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 17.5n, 25p, 25p, 2.5n, 20n)
Vdd7 v3_st VSS dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 10n, 25p, 25p, 10n, 20n)
