Vdd9 v5_st VSS dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 5n, 25p, 25p, 15n, 20n)
Vdd10 v4_st VSS dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 7.5n, 25p, 25p, 12.5n, 20n)
Vdd11 v6_st VSS dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 2.5n, 25p, 25p, 17.5n, 20n)
x3 VDD vinI VoutI2 VoutQ2 vinQ vinIB VoutIB2 vinQB VoutQB2 VSS 4to4
Vdd12 vXOR VSS dc 0 ac 0 pulse(0, 1.2, 20n, 25p, 25p, 20n, 40n)
